NAME='Uranus'
COVER_SUB='What awakens a generation, seven years in each sign.'
T=[
("1927–35 · 2010–18","Uranus in Aries brings sudden independence. This is the generation of the pioneer and the rebel, quick to break with tradition, restless to act and ready to start from zero. Individuality is fiercely defended. The shadow is recklessness and revolution without a plan. The lesson: freedom needs a direction."),
("1935–42 · 2018–26","Uranus in Taurus shakes what feels secure: money, land, food and the body. This generation reinvents how we earn, spend and value things, often by disrupting the old economy, and it craves stability while forcing change. The shadow is stubbornness against change. The lesson: security is a living thing that evolves."),
("1942–49 · 2025–33","Uranus in Gemini electrifies communication. Language, media, technology and learning change at speed, and this generation thinks in networks, hyperlinks and quick exchanges. Ideas are original and often restless. The shadow is nervous overload and information without wisdom. The lesson: curiosity needs depth."),
("1949–56","Uranus in Cancer unsettles home and family. This generation grew up as traditional households changed, and it questions what family, belonging and nationality mean. Emotional independence runs alongside deep need for roots. The shadow is insecurity under the rebellion. The lesson: a home can be chosen."),
("1955–62","Uranus in Leo brings individual creativity into the open. This generation values self-expression, originality and personal freedom, and it grew up with new forms of entertainment and leadership. The shadow is ego and the need to be unique. The lesson: stand out by giving, not only by being different."),
("1961–69","Uranus in Virgo reshapes work, health and daily routine. This generation questions old systems of service, technology and well-being, and brings new methods to old tasks. The shadow is anxiety and nitpicking about change. The lesson: improvement is a continuing practice."),
("1968–75","Uranus in Libra transforms relationships, justice and social ideals. This generation challenges conventional marriage, partnership and equality, and values fairness over tradition. Separation and change are part of its learning. The shadow is instability in love. The lesson: freedom and commitment can coexist."),
("1974–81","Uranus in Scorpio awakens depth, power and taboo. This generation faces sexuality, secrecy, shared money and psychological truths with unusual candour, and it brings transformation through crisis. The shadow is obsession and extremes. The lesson: rebirth begins with honesty."),
("1981–88","Uranus in Sagittarius opens the horizon. This generation is idealistic, global and eager to break boundaries of belief, travel and culture. It questions dogma and seeks freedom of thought. The shadow is fanaticism and restlessness. The lesson: freedom of belief includes tolerance."),
("1988–96","Uranus in Capricorn shakes institutions. This generation grew up with the collapse of old structures and builds new systems of work, government and technology from the ground. The shadow is rigid rebellion against authority. The lesson: structures can be redesigned, not only destroyed."),
("1996–2003","Uranus in Aquarius is at home: originality, humanitarian ideals and technology. This generation naturally thinks in networks, science and community, and it questions social norms. The shadow is detachment and ideology over people. The lesson: the future is built with, not just for, others."),
("2003–11","Uranus in Pisces dissolves boundaries. This generation lives with fluid identity, spirituality outside institutions and a new relationship with imagination, music and the digital dream. The shadow is confusion and escape. The lesson: intuition can be a form of awakening."),
]
